  "attempts": 3,
  "why": "a timeout scaled to size (not a flat 480 s): 120 s plus the size at 150 kB/s. Lowered from 2 MB/s on 2026-09-30: the lab reads the MFWD FTP (dataserv.ub.tum.de) at about 460 kB/s (25 s probe), so every 300 MB tray failed its deadline (the first L16L fetch of mediatum_1717366, download_failed); 150 kB/s leaves a third of the measured rate. read_timeout_s still refuses a stalled connection."
 },
